\p
\v 8 The¦111701 warriors from Yehudah¦111703 attacked¦111700 Yerushalem¦111704 and¦111705 captured¦111705 the city, killing¦111707 the inhabitants and setting the city on¦111704 fire¦111715.
\v 9 Then¦111717 they¦111718 fought¦111721 against¦111722 the Canaanites¦111722 who¦111723 lived¦111723 in the¦111724 hill¦111724 country¦111724, in the southern \add wilderness\add*, and¦111717 in the \add western\add* foothills.
