\v 1 \add But\add* then¦115725 the¦115727 Efrayimite men¦115727 \add ≈challenged\add* Gideon, “Why have¦115733 you \add ≈side-tracked\add* us? Why didn't¦115735 you call¦115736 us¦115737 when you¦115739 went¦115739 to¦115740 battle¦115740 against¦115741 the Midianites?” And¦115742 they¦115742 severely rebuked him¦115743.
