\v 2 “What¦115748 \add ≈have¦115750 I¦115750 achieved compared¦115752 to¦115747 you¦115752 guys\add*?” \add ≈answered¦115746\add* \add @Gideon¦115747\add*. “Aren't the¦115755 \add ≈seconds\add* of¦115755 Efrayim's¦115756 grapes¦115757 better¦115754 than¦115757 the¦115757 \add whole\add* grape¦115757 harvest¦115757 of¦115757 Abiezer¦115758?
