\v 4 Then¦115786 Gideon¦115787 and¦115786 his three¦115791 hundred¦115793 warriors crossed the Yordan¦115788 \add going east\add*. They were¦115789 \add ≈all exhausted¦115797, but¦115786 continued the pursuit¦115798\add*.
