\v 6 \add ≈However, the¦115824 Sukkot¦115825 officials¦115824 asked¦115823\add* \add cautiously\add*, “\add ≈Do you already have Zebah¦115827 and¦115823 Zalmunna¦115828 in¦115830 your¦115830 grasp\add* that we¦115833 should give¦115833 \add ≈food¦115835\add* to¦115834 \em your\em* army¦115834?”
