\v 21 Then¦116792 Yotam¦116793 fled¦116792 away and escaped and went¦116795 to¦116796 Be'er¦116796 and¦116797 settled there¦116798 away from¦116799 the presence¦116799 of¦116799 his¦116801 \add half-\add*brother¦116801 Abimelek¦116800.
\rem /s1 Shechem's Revolt against Abimelech; The Downfall of Abimelech
