\v 2 and¦119400 he¦119400 went \add ≈back home\add* and¦119401 he¦119401 reported¦119401 to¦119402 his¦119402 \add ≈parents¦119403\add*, “I¦119406 saw¦119406 a Philistine woman¦119405 in¦119407 Timnah¦119407 \add ≈that I'd like you to get¦119411 for¦119414 me¦119414 as my\add* wife.”
