\p “Listen,” he¦119688 \add ≈replied¦119675\add*, “I haven't \add even\add* \add ≈told my¦119684 own parents¦119692\add*. Should I tell¦119696 you¦119680?”
\v 17 She¦119698 continued to cry¦119698 beside him¦119699 throughout the seven-day¦119700 party, and then¦119698 \add finally\add* on¦119699 the seventh¦119700 day¦119709, he¦119711 \add gave in and\add* told¦119711 her¦119713 because¦119714 she kept nagging him, \add so in the end\add* she \add ≈was¦119707 able to¦119713 reveal the¦119717 answer to¦119718 her¦119719 relatives\add*.
\v 18 Then¦119721 the¦119723 men¦119723 of¦119723 the¦119724 city¦119724 said¦119721 to¦119738 \add @Shimshon¦119721\add* before¦119727 the¦119729 sun¦119729 went¦119728 down on¦119727 the seventh¦119726 day¦119725,
