\v 11 Then¦119959 three¦119960 thousand¦119961 men¦119962 from Yehudah¦119963 went¦119959 down¦119959 to¦119964 the¦119966 crevice¦119966 in Etam's¦119968 rock¦119967, and¦119959 told¦119969 Shimshon¦119970, “Don't¦119971 you¦119972 realise that¦119980 the Philistines¦119977 are ruling¦119975 over¦119976 us? \add ≈Why¦119973 are you causing¦119973 more¦119973 trouble¦119973 for¦119973\add* us¦119976?”
\p “Just¦119985 as¦119985 they've done¦119986 to¦119987 me¦119987,” he¦119983 \add ≈replied¦119969\add*, “so¦119988 I've¦119989 done¦119989 to¦119990 them¦119990.”
