\v 13 “No¦120014, however, we'll certainly¦120023 tie¦120026 you up,” they \add ≈replied¦120011\add*, “and¦120021 we'll hand¦120022 you over to¦120012 them. But¦120011 truly we won't¦120024 kill¦120025 you.” Then¦120011 they tied¦120026 him up with¦120022 two¦120027 new¦120029 ropes¦120028 and¦120030 brought¦120030 him¦120030 up¦120030 from¦120031 the¦120033 \add #rocks¦120033\add*.
