\m
\v 17 When¦120092 he finished¦120093 \add ≈reciting that\add*, he¦120095 hurled¦120095 the¦120096 jawbone¦120096 \add ≈away\add*, and¦120092 he called¦120098 that place¦120099 ‘Ramat¦120101-Lehi¦120102’ \add (which means ‘jawbone hill’)\add*.
