\p
\v 1 Samson¦120168 went¦120167 to¦120169 Gaza¦120169 \add city\add* and¦120170 he¦120170 saw¦120170 a¦120173 prostitute¦120174 woman¦120173 there¦120172 \add ≈so he¦120175 went¦120175 in to spend the night with\add* her¦120176.
