\v 3 Samson¦120206 \add ≈stayed with¦120213 her\add* until¦120207 the¦120209 middle¦120209 of¦120209 the¦120210 night¦120210, then he¦120211 got¦120215 up. He¦120215 picked¦120215 up both¦120220 the gates¦120217 including¦120205 the cross-bar and their posts¦120221, and¦120222 hoisted them¦120222 up¦120222 onto his¦120229 shoulders¦120229, and¦120230 he¦120230 carried¦120230 them¦120230 up¦120230 to¦120231 the¦120233 top¦120233 of¦120233 the¦120234 hill¦120234 which¦120235 is¦120236 in¦120213 front¦120238 of¦120238 Hebron¦120239.
\s1 Shimshon and Delilah
