\v 7 “If¦120298 they'd tie¦120300 me¦120300 up with¦120301 seven¦120301 green cords¦120302 that¦120304 haven't been¦120307 dried¦120307,” \add *he¦120295\add* \add ≈replied¦120295\add*, “then¦120295 I'd become¦120310 weak¦120310 and¦120295 be¦120310 just like¦120312 any other \add #man¦120312\add*.”
